{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25399","headline":"东郡怀古二首 阳给事 · 李德裕","name":"东郡怀古二首 阳给事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宋氏远家左，豺狼满中州。\n阳君守滑台，终古垂英猷。\n数仞城既毁，万夫心莫留。\n跳身入飞镞，免胄临霜矛。\n毕命在旗下，僵尸横道周。\n义风激河汴，壮气沦山丘。\n嗟尔抱忠烈，古来谁与俦。\n就烹感汉使，握节悲阳秋。\n颜子缀清藻，铿然如素璆。\n徘徊望故垒，尚想精魂游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}